message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "HDT Dome Tile Identification"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Wang"
    given-names: "Yang"
    affiliation: "Universitat Politècnica de València"

version: 1.0.1

date-released: 2026-11-18

repository-code: "https://github.com/wy95877-png/HDT-Dome-Tile-Identification"

abstract: >
  Dynamo and Python workflow for automated component-level identification
  of individual dome tiles in an HBIM model. The workflow performs sector
  classification, local U/V indexing, persistent HDT component identifier
  generation, and automatic assignment of HDT-oriented parameters.

keywords:
  - HBIM
  - Historic Digital Twin
  - Dynamo
  - Revit
  - component identification
  - openBIM
